<div class=3D"mh-comment-content">
<p>Mike, Thank you for your kind words. You ask a good question about learn=
ing by feel, interval, etc. A guitarist would most likely memorize a patter=
n because it is so easy to do. Since you=E2=80=99re flute player, I would l=
earn to modify the major scale that you know. The natural minor scale (Aeol=
ian mode) lowers the 3rd, 6th and 7th by a half step. C major scale has the=
 notes C-D-E-F-G-A-B. C minor scale has the notes C-D-Eb-F-G-Ab-Bb. Of cour=
se, you could build it off the 6th degree of the major scale like you menti=
oned. I hope this helps.</p>
