 and major 7 with Ionion and Lydian. Let=E2=80=99s say we are in C major sc=
ale, and we are playing C major chord followed by a F major forth, I-IV pro=
gression. Can I simply play Ionion for both, since they do have the same no=
te, or should I play Ionion Followed by Lydian, or the other way around? Th=
anks a lot!</p>
