<div class=3D"mh-comment-content">
<p>That was a very helpful reply. Thanks. Now I get why modes are useful. B=
efore, I couldn=E2=80=99t see the point of modes as they are all the same n=
otes!</p>
<p>It makes be think that the most important thing is to know the notes num=
bers for each mode and scale all over the fretboard so using he 1 3 5 7 not=
